# Configuration reference.
#
# The site is a fully static Next.js app PLUS a serverless API in the `/api`
# folder (Azure Functions). Everything below is documented in MAINTENANCE.md.

# --- Build-time (used to generate sitemap, robots, canonical links, metadata) ---

# Canonical site URL. If unset, falls back to https://nabindhungana.com.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://nabindhungana.com

# (Optional) Base URL of the metrics/contact API when it is NOT same-origin,
# e.g. for an isolated preview/staging API. Leave unset to use the same-origin
# `/api/*` (the normal Azure Static Web Apps setup).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=

# --- Server-side secrets (NEVER put real values in this file) ---
#
# These live only in the `/api` Azure Functions and are provided as app-settings
# / environment variables at the hosting platform. They are never compiled into
# the browser bundle. Copy the block below into your deployment's app-settings:

# AZURE_TABLES_CONNECTION_STRING   Azure Storage or Cosmos DB Table connection string
# SENDGRID_API_KEY                 SendGrid API key used to deliver contact emails
# SENDGRID_FROM_EMAIL              Verified SendGrid sender address
# SENDGRID_FROM_NAME               (optional) Sender display name
# CONTACT_TO_EMAIL                 (optional, default nabinndh@gmail.com) contact recipient
